# Microservices: start gateway first:
#   cd IDEA-CODE/services && docker compose up -d
#
# Option A — committed .env.development uses:
#   VITE_API_BASE=http://localhost:8000/api
#
# Option B — delete VITE_API_BASE and use vite.config.ts proxy (/api → :8000).
#
# Wrong: VITE_API_BASE=http://localhost:8000  (must end with /api or requests hit /auth/* → 404)
